{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:56:01+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-13T16:56:01+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Wise Group plc","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"United Kingdom","city":"London","website":"https://wise.com","employees":8805,"summary":"Wise Group plc provides cross-border and domestic financial services in the United Kingdom, the rest of Europe, the Asia-Pacific, North America, and internationally. It offers money transfers, currency conversions, and account services. The company's products include Wise Account, a solution for individual customers to send, spend, hold, and get paid in one or more currencies; Wise Business, which offers the main features of the Wise Account product along with business-specific functionalities designed to enable businesses to operate internationally, including managing their accounting and accounts payable and receivables; and Wise Platform, which enables banks, financial institutions, and enterprises to integrate into a global payment infrastructure, allowing institutional partners to send and receive payments. Wise Group plc was founded in 2010 and is based in London, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"Wise Group plc fournit des services financiers transfrontaliers et nationaux au Royaume-Uni, dans le reste de l'Europe, en Asie-Pacifique, en Amérique du Nord et à l'international. Il offre des transferts d'argent, des conversions de devises et des services de compte. Les produits de la société comprennent Wise Account, une solution permettant aux clients individuels d'envoyer, de dépenser, de conserver et d'être payés dans une ou plusieurs devises; Wise Business, qui offre les principales caractéristiques du produit Wise Account ainsi que des fonctionnalités spécifiques à l'entreprise conçues pour permettre aux entreprises d'opérer à l'international, y compris la gestion de leur comptabilité et de leurs comptes créditeurs et débiteurs; et Wise Platform, qui permet aux banques, aux institutions financières et aux entreprises de s'intégrer dans une infrastructure de paiement mondiale."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":8629842944,"shares_outstanding":964875117,"trailing_pe":24.844444,"forward_pe":18.306862,"price_to_book":626.885,"ev_to_ebitda":-22.308,"ev_to_revenue":-9.046,"dividend_yield":0.0,"payout_ratio":0.0,"beta_yahoo":null},"targets":{"current_price":894.4,"mean":1157.625,"median":1203.0,"high":1500.0,"low":760.0,"n_analysts":16,"reco_mean":1.85,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-12"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":575725500,"ex_dividend":null,"dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.20062,"institutions_pct":0.44447,"institutions_float_pct":0.55602,"institutions_n":531,"institutions":[{"name":"Capital International Investors","pct":0.0355,"shares":36408349,"value":32563628234,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":-0.2083},{"name":"Vanguard Capital Management LLC","pct":0.0214,"shares":21948742,"value":19630955380,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"FIL LTD","pct":0.021,"shares":21487615,"value":19218523380,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.1029},{"name":"Dream Peak Capital Ltd","pct":0.0152,"shares":15591685,"value":13945203444,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"NORGES BANK","pct":0.0146,"shares":14980282,"value":13398364586,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"Wellington Management Group, LLP","pct":0.0128999995,"shares":13204563,"value":11810161469,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"Ninety One UK Ltd","pct":0.0069999998,"shares":7195705,"value":6435838727,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.3743},{"name":"Vanguard Fiduciary Trust Co","pct":0.0063,"shares":6423502,"value":5745180345,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"Goldman Sachs Group Inc","pct":0.0062,"shares":6307552,"value":5641474662,"date":"202